ers like Cooper Nettie's enable you  to build an application that's  homogeneous across a wide variety of  platforms from public clouds to private  clouds to physical infrastructure and  the Google cloud platform as well I hope  I've also shown you how the cluster  management system provides more  robustness for your application and  scalability as well thank you
 

